many people doing this.

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:35.460
Surely when I started my YouTube
channel in January, 2020,

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:36.900
I wouldn't even have believed

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:39.413
that this whole commercial
part is a big part of it all.

00:02:39.413 --> 00:02:41.020
So I do hope that this alone

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:42.890
is also an inspiration to some of you

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:44.230
for people who are maybe are thinking

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:46.160
about starting similar projects like this.

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:47.860
And the first thing
