00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:49.310
when thinking about a YouTube channel,

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:51.560
is the YouTube ad revenue.

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:53.660
So whenever YouTube shows
an ad on your channel

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:55.980
