receives a revenue share

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:57.650
of the income that YouTube gets

00:02:57.650 --> 00:02:59.370
from the company so all of the ad.

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:00.380
For larger channels,

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:03.340
