00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:05.660
or even seven digit annual income.

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:07.900
So what I'm sure is
still far away from that

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:10.430
it still provides me a solid 8% share

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:12.030
of the income that I'm making today.

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:13.240
Next is sponsorships.

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:14.957
So this is like the second
thing that comes to mind

00:03:14.957 --> 00:03:18.090
if you think about
monetizing a YouTube channel.

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:19.460
So yes, I think it's more secret

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:22.320
that companies approach
creators, approach me,

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:24.950
